      "summary": "Implemented the Runtime agent orientation resource path: the Axioma Polis welcome package is loaded as a typed versioned resource, stamped per admitted agent with blake3 delivery provenance, injected ahead of model-facing task content, retained per existing agent across orientation reloads, exposed through the Runtime roster/read model, and rendered by the Observatory as non-authoritative orientation metadata.",
